$* precondition  >'precondition: n != 0'                    : precondition
$* postcondition >'postcondition: r != 0'                   : postcondition
$* invariant     >'invariant: invariant () (on exit)'       : invariant
$* assertion     >'assertion: n != 0'                       : assertion
$* unreachable   >'unreachable: control reached this point' : unreachable

: unknown-check
: Check name that the driver does not know
:
$* contract 2>>EOE != 0
error: unknown check 'contract'
EOE
